 &nbsp; 
 
 What interests me most about this post from Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelensky is not the footage.

 Instead, it's the very specific list of weapons used, including Palianytsia . The other side: President Trump on Truth Social said it was unfortunate that Russia "lost control of its Diesel Oil Industry due to its War with Ukraine."

 He also called the conflict "ridiculous and never ending." Go deeper: Zelensky asked Trump for Tomahawk missiles to force Putin to make peace 

 
 
